{%- doc -%}
  The product page, in the same posture as the homepage.

  Gallery on one side, and on the other the five things a decision is made
  with: the name, the problem the product answers, the price, one button and
  one line about delivery. The problem and answer pair comes from the product's
  own metafields, so nothing here is written by the section.

  The price, the button and the shipping line sit inside one bordered panel,
  the way Chewy separates what a thing is from buying it. On a phone that panel
  is what you land on after the gallery.

  The thumbnail strip is one swipeable row rather than two wrapped ones. Eight
  thumbnails on two rows cost about 90px of height directly above the price,
  which is the last thing worth pushing down a phone screen.

  Below 900px the buy box is a screen and a bit under the fold, so the page also
  carries a fixed bar with the price and the same button. It is the second form
  on the page and posts the same variant; nothing about it is conditional on
  JavaScript.
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- liquid
  assign media = product.media | where: 'media_type', 'image'
  assign hero = product.featured_media
  if hero == blank and media.size > 0
    assign hero = media.first
  endif
  assign problem = product.metafields.custom.problem_line.value
  assign solution = product.metafields.custom.solution_line.value
  assign highlights = product.metafields.custom.highlights.value
  assign spotlight = product.metafields.custom.spotlight.value
-%}

<div class="pl-wrap">
  <div class="wf-pdp">
    <div>
      <div class="wf-pdp__stage">
        {%- if hero != blank -%}
          <img
            id="wf-stage"
            src="{{ hero | image_url: width: 1100 }}"
            srcset="{{ hero | image_url: width: 600 }} 600w, {{ hero | image_url: width: 1100 }} 1100w"
            sizes="(max-width: 900px) 92vw, 52vw"
            width="{{ hero.preview_image.width }}"
            height="{{ hero.preview_image.height }}"
            alt="{{ hero.alt | default: product.title | escape }}"
            fetchpriority="high"
            decoding="async"
          >
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      {%- if media.size > 1 -%}
        <ul class="wf-pdp__thumbs" role="list">
          {%- for item in media -%}
            <li>
              <button
                type="button"
                class="wf-pdp__thumb"
                aria-current="{% if forloop.first %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
                aria-label="תמונה {{ forloop.index }} מתוך {{ media.size }}"
                data-src="{{ item | image_url: width: 1100 }}"
                data-srcset="{{ item | image_url: width: 600 }} 600w, {{ item | image_url: width: 1100 }} 1100w"
              >
                <img src="{{ item | image_url: width: 180 }}" width="{{ item.preview_image.width }}" height="{{ item.preview_image.height }}" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
              </button>
            </li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    <div>
      <h1 class="wf-pdp__title">{{ product.title }}</h1>

      {%- if problem != blank -%}
        <p class="wf-flag__problem">{{ problem }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if solution != blank -%}
        <p class="wf-sub">{{ solution }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%}
        The selling points sit above the buy box, not below it.

        A price and a button reached before the reader knows what the thing is
        asks for a decision that has not been earned yet. These four or five
        lines are the shortest honest answer to "what am I buying", so they go
        in front of the money and the long argument stays behind it. The band
        further down no longer repeats them.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if section.settings.points_above and highlights.size > 0 -%}
        <ul class="wf-points wf-points--lede" role="list">
          {%- for line in highlights -%}
            <li><span class="wf-points__mark" aria-hidden="true">&#10003;</span><span>{{ line }}</span></li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%}
        The three numbers, directly above the price.

        custom.spotlight was written for three products and rendered nowhere.
        It is the only place in the record that states a figure a shopper can
        compare: a 30 centimetre head against a 12, 2.5 times the coverage,
        zero refills. Those are the lines that separate three fur removers that
        otherwise read as the same product at three prices, and a shopper who
        cannot tell them apart does not pick one, they leave.

        It sits immediately above the buy box for the same reason the
        highlights do: it answers "why this one" in the glance before the
        price, not in a band below it.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if spotlight.size > 0 -%}
        <ul class="wf-spot" role="list">
          {%- for item in spotlight -%}
            <li class="wf-spot__i">
              <span class="wf-spot__v">{{ item.value }}</span>
              <span class="wf-spot__l">{{ item.label }}</span>
              {%- if item.note != blank -%}
                <span class="wf-spot__n">{{ item.note }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
      {%- endif -%}

      <div class="wf-buybox">
        <p class="wf-pdp__price">
          {{ product.price | money }}
          {%- if product.compare_at_price > product.price -%}
            <s class="wf-pdp__was">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</s>
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>

        {%- comment -%}
          Unconditional, because the rate behind it is. Shipping is free on
          every order in the Israel zone at any cart total, so this line is not
          a claim about this product clearing a threshold, it is a fact about
          the shop. It sits inside the buy box rather than above it, so it is
          read in the same glance as the price.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <p class="wf-pdp__ship">משלוח חינם, בכל הזמנה</p>

        {%- form 'product', product, class: 'wf-pdp__form' -%}
          <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}">
          <button type="submit" class="wf-btn wf-pdp__submit" {% unless product.available %}disabled{% endunless %}>
            {%- if product.available -%}{{ section.settings.atc_label }}{%- else -%}אזל מהמלאי{%- endif -%}
          </button>
        {%- endform -%}

        {%- if section.settings.note != blank -%}
          <p class="wf-pdp__note">{{ section.settings.note }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      {%- if product.description != blank -%}
        <div class="wf-pdp__rte">{{ product.description }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wf-buybar">
  <span class="wf-buybar__price">{{ product.price | money }}</span>
  {%- form 'product', product, class: 'wf-buybar__form' -%}
    <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}">
    <button type="submit" class="wf-btn wf-buybar__btn" {% unless product.available %}disabled{% endunless %}>
      {%- if product.available -%}{{ section.settings.atc_label }}{%- else -%}אזל מהמלאי{%- endif -%}
    </button>
  {%- endform -%}
</div>
<div class="wf-buybar__spacer" aria-hidden="true"></div>

{%- if media.size > 1 -%}
  <script>
    (function () {
      var stage = document.getElementById('wf-stage');
      var thumbs = document.querySelectorAll('.wf-pdp__thumb');
      if (!stage || !thumbs.length) return;
      thumbs.forEach(function (btn) {
        btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
          stage.srcset = btn.dataset.srcset;
          stage.src = btn.dataset.src;
          thumbs.forEach(function (other) { other.setAttribute('aria-current', other === btn ? 'true' : 'false'); });
        });
      });
    })();
  </script>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "תמות · דף מוצר",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "atc_label", "label": "כפתור הקנייה", "default": "הוספה לסל" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "note", "label": "שורה מתחת לכפתור", "default": "משלוח חינם · 14 יום לביטול עסקה" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "points_above", "label": "נקודות המכירה מעל הכפתור", "default": true }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "תמות · דף מוצר" }]
}
{% endschema %}
